t for a book`.\n\n## Deployment\n\n- Target:\n- Process:\n- Rollback:\n\n## Scheduled Jobs / Workers\n\n- <job>: <schedule/trigger>\n\n## Observability\n\n- Logs:\n- Metrics:\n- Alerts:\n\n## Backup / Restore\n\n- <policy>\n\n## Open Questions\n\n-\n',
